      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, independent English-first proposal. Preserve the fourfold order and distinguish consciousness from known. GANG DE/That remains one relative phrase; shared KYI and GYIS relations stay unbanked rather than choosing arbitrarily among repeated of/by. The YIN/BSHAD naming predicate is distributed into Represents and remains omitted despite a broad glossary candidate. Verse capitalization is retained as lineation, with no new null or source correction."
